{"id": "arriba-juntos-grant-cost-allocation", "title": "Arriba Juntos billed less overall while allocating extra operating costs to grants", "seconds": 52.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "tempo": 1.046, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "84464fce566ee43b", "words": 128, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "An audit of Arriba Juntos found two figures for the same operating costs.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.58, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Two", "totals", "in", "one", "audit"], "sub": "Arriba Juntos"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.64, 0.77, 1.14, 1.7, 1.97, 2.25, 2.67, 2.82, 2.93, 3.26, 3.8]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Human Services was billed more for operating costs than the audit calculated.", "t0": 4.7, "t1": 8.98, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "sf-controller", "text": "Operating costs", "mark": "Operating costs"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.9, 1.08, 1.44, 1.67, 1.89, 2.41, 2.85, 3.03, 3.16, 3.49]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The difference in the supporting table was 196,697 dollars.", "t0": 9.1, "t1": 14.88, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Operating costs", "heading": "Billed and calculated", "source": "audit", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Billed", "value": "$2,709,003"}, {"icon": "audit", "label": "Calculated", "value": "$2,512,306"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.63, 0.71, 0.8, 1.35, 1.74, 1.95, 2.18, 2.55, 3.2, 3.73, 4.01, 4.37, 5.09]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "The report’s headings put the difference 1,000 dollars higher.", "t0": 15.0, "t1": 18.44, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,000", "label": "Difference between headings and table"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.59, 1.04, 1.22, 1.31, 1.79, 2.07, 2.49, 2.92]}, {"scene": "net", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Salaries and fringe benefits were underbilled by 453,124 dollars.", "t0": 18.66, "t1": 25.52, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "sf-controller", "text": "Salaries and fringe benefits", "mark": "Salaries and fringe benefits"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.71, 0.87, 1.23, 1.78, 2.0, 2.59, 2.76, 3.01, 3.34, 3.93, 4.93, 5.22, 5.58, 6.2]}, {"scene": "net", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "Indirect costs were also underbilled.", "t0": 25.64, "t1": 27.69, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Indirect costs"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.49, 0.83, 1.01, 1.36]}, {"scene": "net", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "Across all categories, the audit found underbilling of 282,634 dollars.", "t0": 27.81, "t1": 34.46, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$282,634", "label": "Overall underbilling"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.5, 0.79, 1.48, 1.61, 1.96, 2.3, 3.0, 3.17, 3.41, 3.78, 4.3, 4.83, 5.1, 5.44, 6.03]}, {"scene": "records", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The signed timesheets recorded work without splitting staff effort by grant.", "t0": 34.68, "t1": 38.86, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "sf-controller", "text": "Timesheets", "mark": "Timesheets"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.48, 1.17, 1.6, 1.85, 2.21, 2.71, 3.14, 3.5, 3.68]}, {"scene": "records", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]", "defense[0]"], "text": "The auditors found payroll generally supported and recommended tracking grant-level effort.", "t0": 38.98, "t1": 44.06, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Generally supported payroll"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.7, 0.98, 1.54, 2.0, 2.6, 2.78, 3.37, 3.91, 4.6]}, {"scene": "records", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "next[0]"], "text": "The department’s reconciliation would show any later adjustments to individual grants.", "t0": 44.18, "t1": 48.